{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Cubic Blitz",
    "steam_appid": 3603650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603650/extras/9c0594fb97490fa8d37b185678a940b1.avif?t=1745353331\" data-has-big width=800 height=461 /></span>Cubic Blitz is an isometric puzzle game with over 50 hand-crafted levels. You control a cube, whose goal is to paint the blank tiles of each level according to specific pre-defined colors. You can toggle between viewing the end goal colors and the colors you currently have on the board. There are a multitude of special tiles and changes in the world that will help and hinder you, such as sponges, rain, and even teleporters!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels have a gradual increase in difficulty that allow the player to grow accustomed to the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no time limit - play levels at your own speed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls and movement are straightforward, while also providing levels of depth to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is tracked in each level, offering replayability to beat your previous time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels will test your wits and creativity. Will you be able to overcome the challenges laid out before you and achieve victory?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603650/extras/9c0594fb97490fa8d37b185678a940b1.avif?t=1745353331\" data-has-big width=800 height=461 /></span>Cubic Blitz is an isometric puzzle game with over 50 hand-crafted levels. You control a cube, whose goal is to paint the blank tiles of each level according to specific pre-defined colors. You can toggle between viewing the end goal colors and the colors you currently have on the board. There are a multitude of special tiles and changes in the world that will help and hinder you, such as sponges, rain, and even teleporters!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels have a gradual increase in difficulty that allow the player to grow accustomed to the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no time limit - play levels at your own speed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls and movement are straightforward, while also providing levels of depth to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is tracked in each level, offering replayability to beat your previous time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels will test your wits and creativity. Will you be able to overcome the challenges laid out before you and achieve victory?</p>",
    "short_description": "Cubic Blitz is an isometric puzzle game where you control a cube and solve loads of hand-crafted levels. With the power of paint, sponges, and much more, your task is simple: PAINT THE WORLD.",
